description: Hexagonal dependency rules for TypeScript under src/
globs: src/**/*.ts,tests/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Hexagonal architecture

Full guide: `docs/architecture/hexagonal.md`

- `src/domain/` must not import adapters.
- Inbound adapters must not import outbound adapters — use application ports.
- Wire adapters in `src/main.ts` only.

After layer changes, run `npm run lint:arch`.
